  "subject": "理工学系_情报工学系",
  "text": "求下列矩阵的秩。其中 $b, c$ 是实数。$$A = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 0 & 3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 9 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -3 & -1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix}, \\quad B = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 & b \\\\ -1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}, \\quad C = \\begin{pmatrix} c & c & c & c \\\\ 1 & c & c & c \\\\ 1 & 1 & c & c \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & c \\end{pmatrix}$$",
  "knowledge_points": [
