    {
      "text": "设矩阵 $P = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & a & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & b \\end{pmatrix}$，当参数 $a, b$ 取何值时，$\\text{rank}(P) = 2$？",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "矩阵的秩",
        "参数方程",
        "行列式"
      ],
      "question_type": "参数矩阵秩的讨论",
      "method": [
        "行列式方法",
        "秩的条件"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "秩为2等价于行列式为0",
        "建立参数方程"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "parametric_rank",
        "template": "参数矩阵秩的条件",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求使秩为2的参数条件",
          "steps": [
            "$\\text{rank}(P) = 2$ 当且仅当 $\\det(P) = 0$",
            "$\\det(P) = 1 \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 3 \\\\ -1 & b \\end{vmatrix} - a \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & b \\end{vmatrix} + 2 \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{vmatrix}$",
            "$= (b + 3) - a(2b - 3) + 2(-2 - 1) = b + 3 - 2ab + 3a - 6 = -2ab + 3a + b - 3$",
            "令 $\\det(P) = 0$：$-2ab + 3a + b - 3 = 0$",
            "$3a + b(1 - 2a) = 3$",
            "当 $a = \\frac{1}{2}$ 时，$\\frac{3}{2} = 3$（矛盾），所以 $a \\neq \\frac{1}{2}$",
            "条件：$-2ab + 3a + b - 3 = 0$，或 $b = \\frac{3 - 3a}{2a - 1}$（$a \\neq \\frac{1}{2}$）"
          ]
        }
      ],
